ll/107904.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-09T16:38:28Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107725\r\n\r\nMostly whitespace changes since I tried to make the function easier to read.\r\n\r\n`split_floats` just gives `0.0` when it encounters non-numbers, so I removed it and now check `is_valid_float` for each parameter, with a maximum of 4.\r\nIt must be a float literal, variables and expressions are not allowed here. It may be possible to use Expression to handle them, but it would still need to be readonly.\r\n\r\nAlso added checks when typing a string parameter to only show the color if it is valid and to prevent some invalid color errors (not all, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/89357).\r\n\r\nThis function will need to be moved to be language independent in the future, then it can be parsed better with GDScript.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107904/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url